we_layout.h|r22z:wpe_box_place|1|keep|a member called open
we_prog.c|r22z:e_prj_show_open|5|keep|a variable called open
we_shtok.c|r22z:-|1|keep|a member called open
we_write.c|r22z:write_aim_make|2|keep|a variable called open
we_write.c|r22z:write_keeps_file_ending|1|keep|a variable called open
